Only two of you now, huh?

1213
01:05:19.761 --> 01:05:21.996
Why you run away? Hmm?

1214
01:05:23.798 --> 01:05:25.232
What in hell are those things?

1215
01:05:26.466 --> 01:05:27.534
You just left us there.

1216
