Let's go, let's go!

1222
01:05:46.620 --> 01:05:48.455
-Let's go!
-[breathes heavily, groans]

1223
01:05:48.589 --> 01:05:50.457
-Easy, easy.
-[thudding]

1224
01:05:50.591 --> 01:05:52.626
-We gotta get moving, Keyes.
-[Keyes groaning] Jesus.

1225
01:05:52.760 --> 01:05:54.194
-You good to go?
-[Keyes groans]

1226
01:05:54.328 --> 01:05:56.496
-[Logan] You okay?
-I've been shot, man,

1227
01:05:56.630 --> 01:05:58.398
in dinosaur Vietnam.

1228
01:05:58.532 --> 01:06:01.168
About 12,000 miles
and a million fucking years
from being okay.

1229
01:06:01.301 --> 01:06:02.770
[Logan]
Oh, you're gonna be okay, man.

1230
01:06:02.904 --> 01:06:05.073
God fucking Jesus!
[groaning] Oh!

1231
01:06:05.940 --> 01:06:07.608
Logan, when you're done
patching him up,

1232
01:06:07.742 --> 01:06:09.944
-take point and keep us
in the trees.
-[Logan] Yeah.

1233
01:06:10.078 --> 01:06:11.813
-Through and through, Keyes.
-[Keyes] Oh, fucking Jesus!

1234
01:06:11.946 --> 01:06:14.348
-Fucking-- take it easy.
-Can these things smell blood?

1235
01:06:14.481 --> 01:06:16.383
-Eat shit.
-[Xavier] Zip it, Eli.

1236
01:06:16.918 --> 01:06:18.619
-[Baker] Check fire, Vulture.
-[gasps]

1237
01:06:19.721 --> 01:06:21.321
I'm coming through with Leon
and a hitchhiker.

1238
01:06:21.455 --> 01:06:23.190
[Miller]
Ah, damn, Baker! [laughs]

1239
01:06:23.323 --> 01:06:26.393
-Glad to see you alive
and kicking, man!
-Who's the chick?

1240
01:06:27.028 --> 01:06:29.296
SITREP, who's shooting at you?
What the fuck happened to Keyes?

1241
01:06:29.429 --> 01:06:31.065
I don't know and I have no idea.

1242
01:06:31.933 --> 01:06:34.836
Goddamn flappy fucking big bird
dinosaurs cleaned 'em up.

1243
01:06:35.535 --> 01:06:38.840
Took a round in Keyes' thigh.
He won't be easy to move now.

1244
01:06:39.841 --> 01:06:40.808
-Who's this?
-[Miller] Yeah.

1245
01:06:40.942 --> 01:06:42.110
Just someone who can help.

1246
01:06:42.944 --> 01:06:44.812
Listen, evac is inbound
and Sofia here

1247
01:06:44.946 --> 01:06:46.446
has a safe place to wait it out.

1248
01:06:46.580 --> 01:06:48.215
Let's get him patched up
and move.

1249
01:06:48.281 --> 01:06:49.216
And the skirt?

1250
01:06:50.018 --> 01:06:51.518
[panting]
She knows what's going on?

1251
01:06:51.653 --> 01:06:54.756
She knows more than we do.
She's our ticket outta here.

1252
01:06:54.889 --> 01:06:56.590
I prefer
to think of you as my ride.

1253
01:06:58.225 --> 01:07:02.229
Russians? Our ticket home
is a fucking Russian?

1254
01:07:02.362 --> 01:07:05.099
I'm born in East Berlin,
if that makes you
feel any better.

1255
01:07:05.232 --> 01:07:07.501
It doesn't. No fucking way,

1256
01:07:07.634 --> 01:07:09.236
not after
what we've been through.

1257
01:07:09.336 --> 01:07:11.806
So those guys out there
are fucking Russians

1258
01:07:11.939 --> 01:07:13.340
shooting at us? Not MVA?

1259
01:07:13.473 --> 01:07:14.976
Yeah, and there's likely
more of them out here.

1260
01:07:15.109 --> 01:07:16.944
-[softly] Jesus.
-[growling]

1261
01:07:17.078 --> 01:07:19.246
Whatever these things are,
they were stalking us
last night.

1262
01:07:19.346 --> 01:07:21.115
-[growling]
-[panting]

1263
01:07:21.248 --> 01:07:22.850
Sofia, ideas?

1264
01:07:22.984 --> 01:07:24.786
-[rustling]
-Deinonychus.

1265
01:07:25.452 --> 01:07:28.056
Pack hunters. They like to--
half the pack on the ground

1266
01:07:28.255 --> 01:07:29.623
and the other half
in the treetops.

1267
01:07:30.424 --> 01:07:32.626
Watch for their sickle claws
on each toe.

1268
01:07:33.094 --> 01:07:34.594
What is she,
like a dinosaur freak?

1269
01:07:34.729 --> 01:07:36.630
A dinosaur super freak,
you stupid redneck

1270
01:07:36.764 --> 01:07:38.866
-fascist ass wipe.
-Jesus fucking Christ, lady,

1271
01:07:39.000 --> 01:07:40.267
I was just asking, is all.

1272
01:07:40.400 --> 01:07:41.169
Enough.

1273
01:07:41.301 --> 01:07:43.270
[screeching and growling]

1274
01:07:43.370 --> 01:07:45.405
[dramatic music]

1275
01:07:46.473 --> 01:07:47.875
Fire on anything that moves.

1276
01:07:48.009 --> 01:07:49.309
-[gunshots]
-[screeching]

1277
01:07:49.443 --> 01:07:51.611
[indistinct shouting]

1278
01:07:51.746 --> 01:07:53.047
Watch out! Watch out!

1279
01:07:55.515 --> 01:07:57.384
-[man 1] Xavier!
-[man 2] On your right!

1280
01:07:57.517 --> 01:07:59.053
[indistinct shouting]

1281
01:07:59.187 --> 01:08:00.387
They're in the trees, man!

1282
01:08:00.520 --> 01:08:02.657
[continues indistinctly]

1283
01:08:02.790 --> 01:08:06.560
-[screeching and roaring]
-[man 3] Fuck you!
Fuck you! Fuck you!

1284
01:08:10.397 --> 01:08:11.933
