How many
of these things are there?

1285
01:08:12.066 --> 01:08:13.400
One shot, one kill!

1286
01:08:13.968 --> 01:08:15.069
[Miller]
Oh, fuck!

1287
01:08:17.604 --> 01:08:18.638
[man 2]
Look out, look out!

1288
01:08:19.573 --> 01:08:20.440
Take that.

1289
01:08:21.308 --> 01:08:22.309
Logan!

1290
01:08:23.177 --> 01:08:25.412
-Logan!
-Cease fire! Cease fire!

1291
01:08:25.913 --> 01:08:26.914
It got Keyes!

1292
01:08:27.815 --> 01:08:29.483
-Logan! Logan!
-Wait!

1293
01:08:29.616 --> 01:08:31.318
-Wait!
-You have to run fast
to catch him!

1294
01:08:31.384 --> 01:08:33.620
-They will drag him
until they feel it's safe!
-Fuck.

1295
01:08:34.789 --> 01:08:36.891
-Let's get after him. Go!
-Go, go, go.

1296
01:08:37.859 --> 01:08:39.526
-[growling]
-[Keyes shouts] Baker!

1297
01:08:40.228 --> 01:08:42.096
Fuck-- get the fuck off me,
you little shit!

1298
01:08:42.230 --> 01:08:44.866
Get the fuck off me. Logan!

1299
01:08:44.999 --> 01:08:47.001
-[screeching]
-[grunting]

1300
01:08:47.835 --> 01:08:48.970
Fuck off! [grunts]

1301
01:08:50.037 --> 01:08:52.572
Where the fuck are you,
guys? Fuck!

1302
01:08:52.707 --> 01:08:55.743
-[music continues]
-[grunting continues]

1303
01:08:55.877 --> 01:08:58.246
[screeching]

1304
01:08:58.378 --> 01:08:59.247
[grunts]

1305
01:09:00.748 --> 01:09:02.984
-[screeching]
-[grunting]

1306
01:09:09.657 --> 01:09:11.959
[groans, grunts]

1307
01:09:12.093 --> 01:09:14.128
[snarling]

1308
01:09:14.628 --> 01:09:16.998
-[screeching]
-[blade rings]

1309
01:09:17.899 --> 01:09:20.600
[grunts and pants]

1310
01:09:21.936 --> 01:09:23.938
[snarling and screeching]

1311
01:09:24.906 --> 01:09:27.607
You goddamn fucking
murderous turkeys.

1312
01:09:28.441 --> 01:09:29.476
You coming at me?

1313
01:09:30.377 --> 01:09:32.180
You're gonna need fries
and fucking gravy.

1314
01:09:32.980 --> 01:09:34.916
[screeching]

1315
01:09:35.049 --> 01:09:37.084
[suspenseful music]

1316
01:09:42.556 --> 01:09:44.225
[panting]

1317
01:09:45.827 --> 01:09:47.394
[softly] Oh, yeah.
[loudly] Yeah.

1318
01:09:49.396 --> 01:09:51.631
That's what
I fucking thought. [laughs]

1319
01:09:51.766 --> 01:09:53.400
Ugh, fuck.

1320
01:09:53.533 --> 01:09:55.770
[panting]

1321
01:09:57.104 --> 01:09:58.471
It's so fucking hot.

1322
01:09:59.907 --> 01:10:00.842
Okay.

1323
01:10:03.010 --> 01:10:03.811
[lighter clicks]

1324
01:10:03.945 --> 01:10:05.313
[birds chirping]

1325
01:10:05.445 --> 01:10:08.481
-[soft growling]
-[ominous tone]

1326
01:10:10.117 --> 01:10:11.686
[screeching]

1327
01:10:11.819 --> 01:10:13.587
-[thudding]
-[gasping]

1328
01:10:13.721 --> 01:10:15.690
-[growls]
-[flesh squelching]

1329
01:10:15.823 --> 01:10:17.892
[dramatic music]

1330
01:10:18.025 --> 01:10:20.027
[choking]

1331
01:10:21.128 --> 01:10:23.164
-[flesh squelching]
-[gasping and choking]

1332
01:10:38.478 --> 01:10:40.882
-[Logan shouts] Keyes!
-[growling]

1333
01:10:41.015 --> 01:10:42.549
-[choking]
-[Leon] I swear I heard him.

1334
01:10:42.683 --> 01:10:44.085
-[Xavier] Keyes!
-[Logan] Keyes!

1335
01:10:46.854 --> 01:10:47.989
[indistinct chatter]

1336
01:10:48.588 --> 01:10:50.791
-[growls]
-[breathing heavily]

1337
01:10:50.925 --> 01:10:52.693
-[flesh squelching]
-[Xavier] Keyes!

1338
01:10:52.827 --> 01:10:53.794
[indistinct chatter]

1339
01:10:56.030 --> 01:10:58.065
-[blade rings]
-[screeching]

1340
01:10:58.799 --> 01:11:00.001
Oh!

1341
