<i>♪ Another small-town boy</i>
<i>Plucked away from his home ♪</i>

1840
01:35:42.149 --> 01:35:46.086
<i>♪ Revolution, revolution road ♪</i>

1841
01:35:46.220 --> 01:35:50.124
<i>♪ This evil war machine</i>
<i>Will make you beg</i>
<i>On your knees ♪</i>

1842
01:35:50.257 --> 01:35:53.427
<i>♪ Now pull the trigger, son</i>
<i>You're fresh outta 17 ♪</i>

1843
01:35:53.560 --> 01:35:56.363
<i>♪ Go hang up</i>
<i>On the president's phone ♪</i>

1844
01:35:56.497 --> 01:36:00.434
<i>♪ Revolution, revolution road ♪</i>

1845
01:36:00.567 --> 01:36:04.371
<i>♪ They don't give a damn 'bout</i>
<i>The crooks and the thieves ♪</i>

1846
01:36:04.505 --> 01:36:07.876
<i>♪ Let's burn it down</i>
<i>Take a "no" for your sympathy ♪</i>

1847
01:36:08.008 --> 01:36:11.044
<i>♪ We won't back down</i>
<i>Til freedom is found ♪</i>

1848
01:36:11.178 --> 01:36:15.015
-[roaring]
-[vocalizing]

1849
01:36:15.149 --> 01:36:18.152
<i>♪ We will bow down</i>
<i>When peace comes around ♪</i>

1850
01:36:18.285 --> 01:36:22.156
[vocalizing]

1851
01:36:22.289 --> 01:36:25.292
<i>♪ We won't back down</i>
<i>Til freedom is found ♪</i>

1852
01:36:25.426 --> 01:36:29.329
[vocalizing]

1853
01:36:29.463 --> 01:36:32.399
<i>♪ We will bow down</i>
<i>When peace comes around ♪</i>

1854
01:36:32.533 --> 01:36:36.871
[vocalizing]

1855
01:36:37.004 --> 01:36:39.006
[splashing]

1856
01:36:51.653 --> 01:36:53.620
[grumbling and roaring
in the distance]

1857
01:36:53.755 --> 01:36:55.657
[crickets chirping]

1858
01:36:59.159 --> 01:37:00.027
Fuck.

1859
01:37:08.569 --> 01:37:10.170
This looks painfully familiar.

1860
01:37:10.637 --> 01:37:12.874
-[ominous music]
-[flies buzzing]

1861
01:37:14.909 --> 01:37:17.044
Should've stayed
on the damn boat.

1862
01:37:17.110 --> 01:37:18.713
You sure it's this way, comrade?

1863
01:37:19.814 --> 01:37:20.849
It's this way.

1864
01:37:22.282 --> 01:37:25.252
-We push through.
-[softly] Oh, God,
I hate doing that.

1865
01:37:25.385 --> 01:37:28.455
-[growling in the distance]
-[grunting and sighing]

1866
01:37:39.533 --> 01:37:41.703
-[dramatic music]
-[screeching]

1867
01:37:41.836 --> 01:37:44.171
-[Xavier] Oh!
-[Logan] Sarge! Oh, fuck!

1868
01:37:44.304 --> 01:37:46.106
-[Baker] Behind you!
-[yelling]

1869
01:37:46.240 --> 01:37:48.676
-[indistinct shouting]
-[gunshots]

1870
01:37:49.811 --> 01:37:51.211
[man 1]
They're fuckin' everywhere.

1871
01:37:54.548 --> 01:37:57.384
-Fuck off me!
-[growling and screeching]

1872
01:37:57.518 --> 01:38:00.354
-[Sofia shouting]
-[screeching]

1873
01:38:02.690 --> 01:38:04.859
[grunting]

1874
01:38:09.096 --> 01:38:11.231
[groans, grunts]

1875
01:38:11.365 --> 01:38:13.400
[indistinct shouting continues]

1876
01:38:17.304 --> 01:38:18.539
[yelling]

1877
01:38:18.673 --> 01:38:19.674
[blade rings]

1878
01:38:21.341 --> 01:38:23.277
-[groans]
-[muffed gunshots and shouts]

1879
01:38:23.410 --> 01:38:25.445
[music increases]

1880
01:38:28.382 --> 01:38:29.717
[yells]

1881
01:38:30.617 --> 01:38:32.820
-Come and get me!
Come and get me!
-[man 2 shouts] Logan!

1882
01:38:32.954 --> 01:38:34.588
-[Xavier] Guys, we gotta move!
-Logan!

1883
01:38:34.722 --> 01:38:37.659
-[gunshots]
-Take the squad,
I'll go after Logan.

1884
01:38:38.726 --> 01:38:39.694
Come on!

1885
01:38:40.828 --> 01:38:43.798
-Come and get me!
-[splashing]

1886
01:38:43.932 --> 01:38:45.667
Fuck. Shit.

1887
01:38:45.800 --> 01:38:47.634
-[gunshots]
-[screeching]

1888
01:38:47.769 --> 01:38:50.137
I'm done with all you fuckers!

1889
01:38:51.739 --> 01:38:54.408
Get out of my head
with this shit...
[continues indistinctly]

1890
01:38:54.541 --> 01:38:56.276
-[screeching]
-Fuck.

1891
01:38:56.410 --> 01:38:58.913
[indistinct shouting]

1892
01:39:02.549 --> 01:39:04.451
[yells, laugh]

1893
01:39:04.585 --> 01:39:06.486
-[somber music]
-[screeches]

1894
01:39:06.620 --> 01:39:08.255
[Keyes]
<i>You're a goddamn hero, man.</i>

1895
01:39:08.388 --> 01:39:09.523
Thank you, Keyes.

1896
01:39:10.959 --> 01:39:11.926
-[exhales sharply]
-[gunshot]

1897
01:39:12.060 --> 01:39:14.161
[screeching]

1898
01:39:25.272 --> 01:39:27.307
[music increases]

1899
01:39:44.191 --> 01:39:46.360
[thunder rumbling]

1900
01:39:46.861 --> 01:39:49.731
-[static]
-[Baker] We have a visual
on the compound.

1901
01:39:49.864 --> 01:39:54.234
Standby to copy. Grid 197545.

1902
01:39:54.368 --> 01:39:56.370
<i>-How copy? Over.</i>
-Solid copy.

1903
01:39:56.804 --> 01:39:58.405
<i>Say ETA for the extract.</i>

1904
01:39:58.538 --> 01:39:59.841
Uh, 30 mikes.

1905
01:39:59.974 --> 01:40:02.275
Uh, tell the pilots
to look for a big ass fire

1906
01:40:02.409 --> 01:40:04.578
and a pile of rubble
at the grid I just sent.

1907
01:40:04.712 --> 01:40:06.279
[chuckles] Negative, Vulture.

1908
01:40:06.413 --> 01:40:08.783
That is now
a national security site.

1909
01:40:08.916 --> 01:40:11.551
Do not damage or approach it
in any way.

1910
01:40:11.686 --> 01:40:12.987
All right? You know
who you're dealing with?

1911
01:40:13.121 --> 01:40:14.756
I ain't McNeil, all right?

1912
01:40:14.889 --> 01:40:16.590
Yo-- you understand
what I'm saying, Vulture?

1913
01:40:16.724 --> 01:40:18.092
I'm losing the radio, Six.

1914
01:40:18.225 --> 01:40:20.160
I copied,
approach and destroy the site.

1915
01:40:20.293 --> 01:40:21.929
We'll be standing by
for inbound choppers

1916
01:40:22.063 --> 01:40:23.898
and a side of fries.
Vulture out.

1917
01:40:24.832 --> 01:40:26.566
Don't get fucking cute
with me. Hey!

1918
01:40:26.701 --> 01:40:28.102
-[static]
-Hey!

1919
01:40:29.436 --> 01:40:31.105
I will personally crucify
that motherfucker.

1920
01:40:31.238 --> 01:40:32.506
You might wanna think
that over, Colonel.

1921
01:40:32.639 --> 01:40:34.241
A man who saves the world
from a swarm of dinosaurs

1922
01:40:34.374 --> 01:40:36.077
-might just be a hero
to some folks.
-Not if anyone

1923
01:40:36.209 --> 01:40:37.879
hears about it, all right?

1924
01:40:39.013 --> 01:40:41.816
Fuck, I need, I need,
uh, escorts fueled up

1925
01:40:41.949 --> 01:40:43.651
and armed to the fucking teeth,
all right?

1926
01:40:43.785 --> 01:40:45.385
We're gonna show 'em
what millions of years

1927
01:40:45.519 --> 01:40:46.988
of evolution accomplishes.

1928
01:40:47.121 --> 01:40:48.756
Might be better
that site get destroyed

1929
01:40:48.890 --> 01:40:50.725
than let that stuff fall
into any hands.

1930
01:40:50.858 --> 01:40:54.162
-Ours or theirs.
-Yeah, well, you pussies
better get fueled up

1931
01:40:54.294 --> 01:40:55.195
and get ready.

1932
01:40:55.328 --> 01:40:57.364
[tense music]

1933
01:41:00.600 --> 01:41:02.036
Leon, you still got
the demo kits?

1934
01:41:02.170 --> 01:41:03.838
-Yes, sir.
-Outstanding.

1935
01:41:04.471 --> 01:41:08.275
Rig at least three full charges
at the base of the site.

1936
01:41:08.375 --> 01:41:11.012
Dig 'em in. I wanna see
that fucking structure collapse

1937
01:41:11.145 --> 01:41:14.082
-when they blow. Miller, Eli.
-[Miller] Sir.

1938
01:41:14.281 --> 01:41:17.617
Find and rig
any shipments outside.
And Xavier, find high ground.

1939
01:41:18.351 --> 01:41:20.487
Cover me when I move inside
and pull the plug.

1940
01:41:20.620 --> 01:41:22.790
Plug, Sarge?
You even know where to look?

1941
01:41:22.924 --> 01:41:24.759
I know. I will go
with Sergeant Baker.

1942
01:41:25.793 --> 01:41:27.061
[Baker]
Drop pack, let's go.

1943
01:41:28.395 --> 01:41:29.296
Miller.

1944
01:41:30.497 --> 01:41:31.364
Grenade.

1945
01:41:32.466 --> 01:41:34.802
You reckon the colonel's
really gonna send the choppers?

1946
01:41:35.635 --> 01:41:37.772
You just pissed him off enough
to make him forget about it.

1947
01:41:38.873 --> 01:41:41.508
-He'll send them.
He owes me that much.
-[thunder rumbling]

1948
01:41:41.641 --> 01:41:44.746
Sarge, who is McNeil?

1949
01:41:46.881 --> 01:41:48.950
McNeil was the original
leader of Vulture Squad.

1950
01:41:49.083 --> 01:41:50.918
Picked me fresh out of ROTC.

1951
01:41:52.153 --> 01:41:55.056
-And he was everything
a leader should be.
-What happened to him, Sarge?

1952
01:41:57.390 --> 01:42:00.061
Long story short,
he got fucked over by Jericho.

1953
01:42:00.560 --> 01:42:03.164
And he took the fall
on a failed airstrike mission.

1954
01:42:03.330 --> 01:42:04.165
We--

1955
01:42:05.365 --> 01:42:06.834
we lost most of the unit.

1956
01:42:08.368 --> 01:42:10.604
McNeil got a discharge
and I wound up in hospital

1957
01:42:10.738 --> 01:42:12.907
with a lot of dead brothers
on my conscience.

1958
01:42:13.040 --> 01:42:15.076
[somber music]

1959
01:42:15.676 --> 01:42:17.712
And shit, I got
a lot of live ones too.

1960
01:42:20.114 --> 01:42:23.017
I don't know about you,
Vultures, ma'am,

1961
01:42:23.785 --> 01:42:25.820
but I'm about ready
to bring it all on home.

1962
01:42:27.354 --> 01:42:29.523
-Cool.
-Let's get to work.

1963
01:42:29.657 --> 01:42:31.893
[dramatic, inspirational music]

1964
01:42:39.133 --> 01:42:41.568
[speaking in Russian]

1965
01:42:49.710 --> 01:42:51.746
[electricity crackling]

1966
01:43:07.695 --> 01:43:09.730
[upbeat suspenseful music]

1967
01:43:14.401 --> 01:43:16.003
[thunder rumbling]

1968
01:43:16.137 --> 01:43:18.139
-[thudding]
-[groaning]

1969
01:43:19.406 --> 01:43:20.507
[panting]

1970
01:43:22.143 --> 01:43:23.811
[indistinct chatter]

1971
01:43:26.546 --> 01:43:27.547
-[grunts]
-[groans]

1972
01:43:27.682 --> 01:43:28.649
[thudding]

1973
01:43:30.417 --> 01:43:31.418
Good fucking shit.

1974
01:43:34.989 --> 01:43:36.924
[speaking in Russian]

1975
01:43:43.865 --> 01:43:44.932
-[blade rings]
-[groans]

1976
01:43:45.066 --> 01:43:46.300
[thudding]

1977
01:43:46.433 --> 01:43:48.501
[thunder rumbling]

1978
01:43:49.303 --> 01:43:51.339
[in Russian accent]
The dogs of war,

1979
01:43:52.006 --> 01:43:54.441
you have returned just in time.

1980
01:43:55.009 --> 01:43:58.578
-One more test run tonight.
-Your big machine is in there?

1981
01:43:58.713 --> 01:44:00.748
[light ominous music]

1982
01:44:01.249 --> 01:44:02.149
It is.

1983
01:44:04.118 --> 01:44:05.019
What's it do?

1984
01:44:05.753 --> 01:44:08.756
I wouldn't expect you
to understand.

1985
01:44:08.890 --> 01:44:10.925
[Con Nhen]
So, my dealings with you...

1986
01:44:12.459 --> 01:44:13.261
...all done?

1987
01:44:15.229 --> 01:44:17.832
[Borodin]
Just so, my dear.

1988
01:44:20.301 --> 01:44:23.536
-[continues indistinctly]
-[speaking in Russian]

1989
01:44:31.646 --> 01:44:35.116
...and I wish you good luck
in striking the Yankees

1990
01:44:35.249 --> 01:44:38.986
out of the skies
over your homeland.

1991
01:44:39.687 --> 01:44:45.492
You have turned my homeland
into dinner for monsters.

1992
01:44:46.093 --> 01:44:48.129
[man speaking in Russian
in the distance]

1993
01:44:51.866 --> 01:44:53.734
[Borodin speaking indistinctly]

1994
01:44:53.868 --> 01:44:56.536
-That's Borodin.
-I know those men.

1995
01:44:58.339 --> 01:45:00.174
Did you know
of the monsters out there?

1996
01:45:00.308 --> 01:45:03.678
Mere beasts, not monsters!

1997
01:45:04.511 --> 01:45:08.182
-Beasts of burden...
-They must be the men
who ambushed your team.

1998
01:45:08.950 --> 01:45:11.018
And now they're questioning
their allegiance.

1999
01:45:11.852 --> 01:45:14.922
Where are Americans?

2000
01:45:15.056 --> 01:45:16.891
Dead by now.

2001
01:45:18.025 --> 01:45:19.526
Nothing can survive out there.

2002
01:45:21.028 --> 01:45:22.964
Trying to talk Borodin
into more caution,

2003
01:45:23.530 --> 01:45:25.900
saying dinosaurs might wind up
in the Red Square.

2004
01:45:26.434 --> 01:45:28.369
[Baker]
Is there any chance he'll stop?

2005
01:45:28.535 --> 01:45:31.439
<i>Nyet.</i> Borodin used them
like he used me.

2006
01:45:32.073 --> 01:45:35.542
The only monsters
I released in this valley

2007
01:45:35.608 --> 01:45:37.577
are men like you.

2008
01:45:38.412 --> 01:45:40.214
You were told to fetch

2009
01:45:40.348 --> 01:45:43.684
and you happily went
out there looking to kill.

2010
01:45:43.818 --> 01:45:47.254
-You madman!
-[speaking in Russian]

2011
01:45:50.825 --> 01:45:53.560
-Do it.
-[speaking in Russian]

2012
01:45:55.029 --> 01:45:57.564
You are a threat to history.
To the people.

2013
01:45:57.665 --> 01:45:59.667
[ominous music]

2014
01:46:00.567 --> 01:46:02.370
We need to find a way in there.

2015
01:46:03.570 --> 01:46:04.571
Come on.

2016
01:46:09.810 --> 01:46:11.746
[gunshots in the distance]

2017
01:46:11.879 --> 01:46:13.580
[loudly] With me! Now!

2018
01:46:13.681 --> 01:46:15.716
-[dramatic music]
-[screeching in the distance]

2019
01:46:36.270 --> 01:46:37.505
Americans.

2020
01:46:38.439 --> 01:46:41.776
General, I found this one
sniffing around the camp.

2021
01:46:42.376 --> 01:46:44.644
There was another one,
but he hid in the trees.

2022
01:46:45.612 --> 01:46:47.381
What is this thing, General?

2023
01:46:47.515 --> 01:46:49.216
You fool.

2024
01:46:49.817 --> 01:46:52.386
Don't you know
what you have done?

2025
01:46:53.087 --> 01:46:54.789
[man speaking in Russian]

2026
01:46:57.925 --> 01:46:59.827
-[grunting]
-[thudding]

2027
01:47:00.761 --> 01:47:02.263
[indistinct chatter]

2028
01:47:02.396 --> 01:47:04.165
[speaking in Russian]

2029
01:47:04.298 --> 01:47:06.367
Shut the fuck up.

2030
01:47:09.670 --> 01:47:13.207
-Okay.
-I'm the one that helped
Borodin with dinosaurs.

2031
01:47:13.340 --> 01:47:16.444
This all needs to end
or he will destroy everything.

2032
01:47:16.643 --> 01:47:18.312
The asshole needs to be stopped.

2033
01:47:19.413 --> 01:47:20.648
Do you wanna join us?

2034
01:47:21.449 --> 01:47:23.417
<i>-Da.</i> We will.
<i>-Da.</i>

2035
01:47:24.418 --> 01:47:26.253
-We got incoming.
-[Sofia] Incoming?

2036
01:47:26.387 --> 01:47:28.355
Yeah, big incoming.

2037
01:47:28.923 --> 01:47:30.791
[thunder rumbling]

2038
01:47:32.326 --> 01:47:34.328
[suspenseful music]

2039
01:47:34.995 --> 01:47:36.397
What is this thing, General?

2040
01:47:37.898 --> 01:47:39.400
Get rid of it.

2041
01:47:39.533 --> 01:47:41.502
-[growling]
-[soldiers gasps]

2042
01:47:41.669 --> 01:47:43.671
[indistinct chatter]

2043
01:47:48.275 --> 01:47:49.944
[shushes]

2044
01:47:52.046 --> 01:47:53.347
[softly] Don't shoot.

2045
01:47:55.382 --> 01:47:56.817
[snarling]

2046
01:48:02.356 --> 01:48:04.558
[roaring]

2047
01:48:05.259 --> 01:48:07.261
-[gunshots]
-[indistinct shouting]

2048
01:48:07.394 --> 01:48:09.430
[dramatic music]

2049
01:48:10.965 --> 01:48:13.968
-[clanking]
-[roaring]

2050
01:48:14.101 --> 01:48:15.503
-[screaming]
-[squelching]

2051
01:48:16.537 --> 01:48:18.539
[thudding]

2052
01:48:20.007 --> 01:48:21.475
[screaming]

2053
01:48:23.244 --> 01:48:26.147
-[gunshots]
-[roaring]

2054
01:48:26.280 --> 01:48:28.582
-[shouting continues]
-[clanking]

2055
01:48:29.817 --> 01:48:31.252
[screaming]

2056
01:48:33.154 --> 01:48:36.290
[screaming]

2057
01:48:42.730 --> 01:48:44.965
[roaring]

2058
01:48:46.934 --> 01:48:48.936
[man shouting in Russian]

2059
01:48:49.069 --> 01:48:51.105
[music continues]

2060
01:48:53.641 --> 01:48:55.209
[roaring in the distance]

2061
01:49:00.314 --> 01:49:02.550
-[crashing]
-[glass shattering]

2062
01:49:03.751 --> 01:49:05.819
[growling]

2063
01:49:09.456 --> 01:49:11.926
[both roaring]

2064
01:49:12.661 --> 01:49:14.828
[gunshots]

2065
01:49:14.962 --> 01:49:16.997
[shouting
and screaming continue]

2066
01:49:20.669 --> 01:49:23.837
-[roaring]
-[screaming]

2067
01:49:33.682 --> 01:49:35.916
[engine rumbling]

2068
01:49:37.017 --> 01:49:40.054
[shouting in Russian]

2069
01:49:41.455 --> 01:49:43.190
-[groaning]
-[screaming]

2070
01:49:44.124 --> 01:49:45.426
Go! Get inside!

2071
01:49:45.559 --> 01:49:47.595
[thunder rumbling]

2072
01:49:49.496 --> 01:49:50.364
[Baker]
Let's go.

2073
01:49:51.365 --> 01:49:54.568
-[roaring]
-[helicopter blades whirring]

2074
01:49:54.703 --> 01:49:56.804
[gunshots]

2075
01:49:57.638 --> 01:49:59.240
[roaring]

2076
01:49:59.373 --> 01:50:01.108
Target on the move.

2077
01:50:01.242 --> 01:50:02.343
[Borodin]
...out of my way!

2078
01:50:02.476 --> 01:50:04.545
[shouting in Russian]

2079
01:50:05.379 --> 01:50:06.213
[Baker muffled]
Okay, let's move.

2080
01:50:06.347 --> 01:50:07.548
[Leon breathes loudly]

2081
01:50:07.682 --> 01:50:08.616
Fuck, fuck.

2082
01:50:10.251 --> 01:50:11.619
[shouts] You sure
about this, Sarge?

2083
01:50:11.752 --> 01:50:13.420
-[roaring]
-[shouting]

2084
01:50:13.554 --> 01:50:15.022
[indistinct yelling]

2085
01:50:15.155 --> 01:50:16.691
[Baker]
This way! This way!

2086
01:50:16.824 --> 01:50:18.626
[cross talk]

2087
01:50:19.226 --> 01:50:20.494
Back, back, back, back!

2088
01:50:21.829 --> 01:50:23.530
[roaring]

2089
01:50:24.198 --> 01:50:25.199
-Go! Go, go!
-Go, go, go!

2090
01:50:25.332 --> 01:50:26.300
Move, move!

2091
01:50:26.433 --> 01:50:28.703
[Sofia]
Follow me. Sergeant!

2092
01:50:28.836 --> 01:50:31.171
-Here, here.
-[Leon] Inside, inside, inside!

2093
01:50:31.706 --> 01:50:33.742
-[roaring]
-[thudding]

2094
01:50:34.341 --> 01:50:36.243
We go now!

2095
01:50:36.377 --> 01:50:37.746
-Wire the collider.
-[speaks in Russian]

2096
01:50:37.878 --> 01:50:39.748
Do not wait for my command.

2097
01:50:39.880 --> 01:50:41.716
-[continues indistinctly]
-[cross talk]

2098
01:50:42.283 --> 01:50:44.051
[gunshots]

2099
01:50:44.918 --> 01:50:45.786
[Eli shouts]
Miller!

2100
01:50:47.821 --> 01:50:49.323
[explosion]

2101
01:50:49.890 --> 01:50:51.325
Miller, where are you?

2102
01:50:51.458 --> 01:50:53.494
-[dramatic music]
-[indistinct shouting]

2103
01:50:55.697 --> 01:50:56.797
-[groans]
-Demon!

2104
01:50:56.930 --> 01:50:58.832
You demon! [grunts]

2105
01:50:58.966 --> 01:51:01.969
American demon!
You kill my family!

2106
01:51:02.102 --> 01:51:04.371
[both grunting and groaning]

2107
01:51:06.307 --> 01:51:07.274
-[speaks in Vietnamese]
-[blade rings]

2108
01:51:07.408 --> 01:51:08.942
-[groans]
-[grunts]

2109
01:51:09.076 --> 01:51:10.344
[shouts]

2110
01:51:10.878 --> 01:51:13.380
-[grunting]
-[blade ringing]

2111
01:51:15.750 --> 01:51:17.752
[roaring]

2112
01:51:18.452 --> 01:51:19.520
-Oh, shit.
-[gasps]

2113
01:51:19.654 --> 01:51:21.690
[gunshots]

2114
01:51:25.694 --> 01:51:26.894
[Eli shouts]
Miller!

2115
01:51:28.562 --> 01:51:31.398
[chatter in Russian]

2116
01:51:32.566 --> 01:51:33.702
-[gunshots]
-[groans]

2117
01:51:33.901 --> 01:51:35.704
-[thudding]
-[whirring]

2118
01:51:36.437 --> 01:51:38.105
-Anyone else wanna be a hero?
-[Tolstoy] Hands up!

2119
01:51:38.238 --> 01:51:40.174
'Cause this will be
a real quick conversation.

2120
01:51:40.307 --> 01:51:41.942
[speaks in Russian]

2121
01:51:42.076 --> 01:51:44.111
The collider is still charging,
could go off any minute.

2122
01:51:44.244 --> 01:51:45.112
Get on it.

2123
01:51:46.347 --> 01:51:50.217
Leon, take the Russkies.
Keep planting the C4
and rig whatever else you can.

2124
01:51:50.351 --> 01:51:51.952
-Leave nothing behind.
-Let's go.

2125
01:51:52.419 --> 01:51:55.155
-[indistinct chatter on PA]
-[gunshots]

2126
01:51:55.289 --> 01:51:56.825
[roaring]

2127
01:52:04.699 --> 01:52:06.801
[thudding and crashing]

2128
01:52:11.305 --> 01:52:12.506
[Miller]
Please, forgive me.

2129
01:52:12.639 --> 01:52:13.941
No forgiveness!

2130
01:52:14.041 --> 01:52:16.076
-[yelling]
-[blade ringing]

2131
01:52:23.183 --> 01:52:24.284
Miller!

2132
01:52:25.586 --> 01:52:27.054
[groaning]

2133
01:52:27.588 --> 01:52:31.392
-[blade rings]
-You will die,
but we will rebuild!

2134
01:52:33.594 --> 01:52:37.030
God, forgive me.
God, forgive me!

2135
01:52:37.164 --> 01:52:39.199
-[dramatic, somber music]
-[echoing explosions]

2136
01:52:40.835 --> 01:52:42.102
-No!
-[clicks]

2137
01:52:43.036 --> 01:52:45.339
[explosions]

2138
01:52:48.375 --> 01:52:49.543
Miller!

2139
01:53:03.858 --> 01:53:05.993
[both grumbling]

2140
01:53:09.697 --> 01:53:11.699
-[alarm buzzing]
-Hey! I thought
all you had to do

2141
01:53:11.833 --> 01:53:13.367
was pull the plug.

2142
01:53:13.835 --> 01:53:16.170
It's too late.
It's set to automatic discharge.

2143
01:53:16.303 --> 01:53:18.439
I have to take console apart
and do a rewiring.

2144
01:53:18.572 --> 01:53:21.375
-How long is that gonna take?
-F-- a few minutes. Then finish.

2145
01:53:22.209 --> 01:53:23.745
-Focus.
-Focus.

2146
01:53:23.878 --> 01:53:26.246
[speaking in Russian]

2147
01:53:26.380 --> 01:53:28.415
-[rumbling]
-[electricity crackling]

2148
01:53:30.584 --> 01:53:32.619
-Sofia.
-Don't worry.

2149
01:53:32.754 --> 01:53:34.856
Husband taught me fail-safes
and I'm never wrong.

2150
01:53:35.757 --> 01:53:37.191
Oh, I-- I hope.

2151
01:53:37.324 --> 01:53:39.293
[whirring]

2152
01:53:39.426 --> 01:53:41.628
[dramatic music]

2153
01:53:41.763 --> 01:53:46.668
Vulture One, Vulture One.
Father Vulture. How copy, over.

2154
01:53:48.135 --> 01:53:50.437
Vulture, can you hear me?
This is Six.

2155
01:53:50.571 --> 01:53:55.375
Listen to me, all right?
I want that compound
secured and untouched.

2156
01:53:55.509 --> 01:53:59.046
You understand me? Hello.
Mother fuck-- Hello!

2157
